Export the lockstep hook from modules built with MinGW compilers
Exporta el gancho lockstep de los módulos compilados con compiladores MinGW

Applies to / Se aplica a:
  ModernGekko edd460a, vendor/dolphin (RecompCore) 10f7ac4, the versions that
  scripts/build_and_run_linux.sh pins through ModernGekko-Template c2553a9.

License / Licencia:
